               DESCRIPTION
                   "Indicates the frame type of the ACE.
                    Any: The ACE will match any frame type.
                    EType: The ACE will match Ethernet Type frames.
                    Note that an Ethernet Type based ACE will not get matched
                    by IP and ARP frames.
