		1:C-tag: An inner C-tag is inserted. 
		2:S-tag: An inner S-tag is inserted. 
		3:S-custom-tag: An inner tag is inserted and the tag type is determined by the VLAN port configuration of the NNI."
   ::= {sm24dp4xaEVCControlListConfEntry 8 }     
   
sm24dp4xaEVCControlListConfInnerTagVIDMode OBJECT-TYPE
