sm24dp4xaECECtlListConfIPv4Protocol OBJECT-TYPE
   SYNTAX      Integer32
   MAX-ACCESS  read-create
   STATUS      current
   DESCRIPTION
       "The IP protocol for matching the ECE. The possible values are: 
