		2:Range: If you want to filter a specific DSCP range filter with this ECE, choose this value. A field for entering a range appears."
   ::= {sm24dp4xaECEControlListConfEntry 35 }    
   
sm24dp4xaECECtlListConfIPv4DSCPRangeLow OBJECT-TYPE
   SYNTAX      Integer32
   MAX-ACCESS  read-create
   STATUS      current
   DESCRIPTION
       "When Specific is selected for the DSCP filter, you can enter a specific value. 
