   ::= {sm24dp4xaECEControlListConfEntry 36 }    

sm24dp4xaECECtlListConfIPv4DSCPRangeHigh OBJECT-TYPE
   SYNTAX      Integer32
   MAX-ACCESS  read-create
   STATUS      current
   DESCRIPTION
       "When Range is selected for the DSCP filter, you can enter a specific range. 
